<div class="modal fade" id="connection-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><div><span class="modal-kicker">REMOTE CONNECTION</span><h2 class="modal-title">添加服务器</h2></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div><form id="connection-form"><div class="modal-body"><input type="hidden" name="id"><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">显示名称</label><input class="form-control" name="name" placeholder="我的 Palworld 服务器" required></div><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-7"><label class="form-label">主机地址</label><input class="form-control" name="host" placeholder="192.168.1.20" required></div><div class="col-5"><label class="form-label">REST 端口</label><input class="form-control" name="restPort" type="number" value="8212"></div><div class="col-7"><label class="form-label">管理员用户名</label><input class="form-control" name="username" value="admin"></div><div class="col-5"><label class="form-label">RCON 端口</label><input class="form-control" name="rconPort" type="number" value="25575"></div></div><div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">管理员密码</label><input class="form-control" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="输入 AdminPassword"></div><div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">扩展数据 JSON 路径 <span class="text-secondary">（可选）</span></label><input class="form-control" name="supplementalDataPath" placeholder="D:\\PalworldData\\server-data.json 或 \\\\server\\share\\server-data.json"><div class="form-text">用于公会、帕鲁、物品和离线玩家；可由存档解析器或服务器代理定期导出。</div></div><div class="form-check form-switch mt-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="useHttps" id="use-https"><label class="form-check-label" for="use-https">REST API 使用 HTTPS</label></div><div class="security-note"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i><span>连接信息仅保存在此设备的 Electron 用户数据目录。</span></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-surface" data-bs-dismiss="modal">取消</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">保存连接</button></div></form></div></div></div>

<div class="modal fade" id="message-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-sm"><div class="modal-content message-modal"><div class="message-icon"><i class="bi bi-info-lg"></i></div><h2 id="message-title">提示</h2><p id="message-body"></p><div class="message-actions"><button class="btn btn-surface" data-bs-dismiss="modal">关闭</button><button id="message-confirm" class="btn btn-primary d-none">确认</button></div></div></div></div>

<div class="modal fade" id="broadcast-modal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><div><span class="modal-kicker">IN-GAME MESSAGE</span><h2 class="modal-title">游戏内广播</h2></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div><form id="broadcast-form"><div class="modal-body"><label class="form-label">广播内容</label><textarea class="form-control" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="500" placeholder="输入要发送给全部在线玩家的消息…" required></textarea><div class="security-note"><i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i><span>消息将通过 RCON Broadcast 命令立即发送。</span></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-surface" data-bs-dismiss="modal">取消</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">发送广播</button></div></form></div></div></div>

<div class="modal fade" id="player-modal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><div><span class="modal-kicker">PLAYER PROFILE</span><h2 id="player-modal-title" class="modal-title">玩家详情</h2></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div id="player-summary" class="detail-grid"></div><ul class="nav detail-tabs"><li><button class="active" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#player-pals">帕鲁列表</button></li><li><button data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#player-items">物品列表</button></li></ul><div class="tab-content"><div id="player-pals" class="tab-pane fade show active collection-grid"></div><div id="player-items" class="tab-pane fade collection-grid"></div></div></div></div></div></div>

<div class="modal fade" id="guild-modal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><div><span class="modal-kicker">GUILD PROFILE</span><h2 id="guild-modal-title" class="modal-title">公会详情</h2></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div id="guild-summary" class="detail-grid"></div><h3 class="detail-heading">公会成员</h3><div id="guild-members" class="member-list"></div></div></div></div></div>
